{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No useless plot guidance! Pure Roguelike! Mob - clearing! Thrilling!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control your character on the battlefield, kill as many monsters as possible before the countdown ends to gather resources while maintaining healthy blood volume.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exchange the experience and treasure chests you've earned for more attributes and items to enhance yourself, and defeat the final boss to achieve victory.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully automatic fire! Playable with one hand! Free up your right (or left) hand!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast - paced, no dragging, each run takes only 20 minutes~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over ten playable characters! Each character has a unique system!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of items with numerous combinations! </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3610410?t=1743526489","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3610410?t=1743526489","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610410/a08f95417175428e648fb9a4b94d32823364b66e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743526489","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610410/a08f95417175428e648fb9a4b94d32823364b66e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743526489","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"descrip